{
  "title": "limit_req 限速实测",
  "lines": [
    {"t": "note", "s": "rate=1r/s burst=3 nodelay，连发 5 个请求（实测）"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "seq 5 | xargs curl -so /dev/null -w \"%{http_code} \" localhost/rate/"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "200 200 200 200 503"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "burst 配额耗尽，第 5 发直接 503"}
